# 17. C's influence

C is much more than simply another programming language.

Many later languages were strongly influenced by C's syntax and design.

```text
              C
              │
      ┌───────┼────────┐
      │       │        │
     C++    Objective-C  C#
      │                │
      │                │
      └──────┬─────────┘
             │
           Java
             │
        many C-like
         languages
```

You can recognize C-style syntax in:

```c
if (...) {
    ...
}
```

Java:

```java
if (...) {
    ...
}
```

JavaScript:

```javascript
if (...) {
    ...
}
```

C++:

```cpp
if (...) {
    ...
}
```

C#:

```csharp
if (...) {
    ...
}
```

So C became an important **syntactic and conceptual ancestor** of modern programming languages.

